  "nonogramTutorialEdgeCell": "The last square is already filled. The block of 4 must include it, so there is only one way to place it: fill the 3 squares to its left.",
  "nonogramTutorialMultipleClues": "More than one number means more than one block, with at least one empty square between them. 2 2 fits these 5 squares in only one way.",
  "nonogramTutorialClueOrder": "Order matters too: 3 1 means the block of 3 comes first, then the block of 1.",
